{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralIntro-3868": "LIEUTENANT: 姓名？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralIntro-3869": "NIKOLAI: 尼古拉·普罗赫上士，第七边防师。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralIntro-3870": "LIEUTENANT: 我看看……普罗赫……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralIntro-3871": "LIEUTENANT: 我的名单上没有他。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralIntro-3872": "SOLDIER: 我这里有，他被编入安赛茨上校麾下了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralIntro-3873": "SOLDIER: 不过有个列兵……嗯……基尔歇尔，要借调给第二十九师。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralIntro-3874": "LIEUTENANT: 基尔歇尔，沿原路返回，去市中心。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralIntro-3875": "LIEUTENANT: 普罗赫，你和你的小队去城西，跟安赛茨的部队会合。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralIntro-3876": "LIEUTENANT: 有些街道堵了，你们得绕远路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralIntro-3877": "NIKOLAI: 是，长官。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralIntro-3878": "NIKOLAI: 基尔歇尔，你是个好兵，希望很快能再见到你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralIntro-3879": "NIKOLAI: 其他人，还有任务要办。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-firstMilitia-3880": "SOLDIER: 民兵想突围！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-airOfficer-3881": "KONITZ: 真不敢相信，就算这么近看着，还是不敢相信。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-airOfficer-3882": "KONITZ: 这些船的引擎，用的是跟我们终端一样的技术吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-airOfficer-3883": "LIEUTENANT: 差不多，你是新来的技术员？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-airOfficer-3884": "KONITZ: 啊……不是，我是边防部队的。能问一句，这艘船出了什么问题吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-airOfficer-3885": "LIEUTENANT: 引擎会从地脉中汲取魔力……非常多的魔力。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-airOfficer-3886": "LIEUTENANT: 不过，这艘船的储能装置出了问题。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-airOfficer-3887": "KONITZ: 哦，难怪整支舰队会把地脉里的魔力都抽干……正常情况下，储能装置能让船运行几个小时？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-airOfficer-3888": "LIEUTENANT: 你这么聪明，待在步兵里干什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-airOfficer-3889": "NIKOLAI: 他正要跟自己的小队一起，去向安赛茨上校报到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-airOfficer-3890": "KONITZ: 哦，对，抱歉，上士。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-airOfficer-3891": "LIEUTENANT: 他说得对，别让安赛茨上校久等，他的关系可不一般。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-anseitzFirstSpeech-3892": "ANSEITZ: 总理自始至终的承诺，现在将由我们兑现！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-anseitzFirstSpeech-3893": "ANSEITZ: 数十名非法施法者，正藏匿在这座城市之中。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-anseitzFirstSpeech-3894": "ANSEITZ: 他们企图充当内应，破坏补给线，让我军困死在卢斯基亚。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-anseitzFirstSpeech-3895": "ANSEITZ: 这些叛乱分子训练有素，狂热偏执。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-anseitzFirstSpeech-3896": "ANSEITZ: 他们会毫不犹豫地杀死你们，甚至不惜同归于尽，还会拿平民当人盾。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-anseitzFirstSpeech-3897": "ANSEITZ: 将他们揪出来的决心绝不可动摇，要让他们见识我们优越的意志，优越的血统！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-anseitzFirstSpeech-3898": "ANSEITZ: 命令已经下达，去吧，让总理为你们骄傲。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-anseitzFirstSpeech-3899": "OFFICER: 上士，你叫什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-anseitzFirstSpeech-3900": "NIKOLAI: 尼古拉·普罗赫，第七边防师，长官。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-anseitzFirstSpeech-3901": "OFFICER: 啊，对，有救火经验的那个，派来的这批人里，只有你按时到了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-anseitzFirstSpeech-3902": "NIKOLAI: 抱歉，长官，我们还没收到任务说明。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-anseitzFirstSpeech-3903": "OFFICER: 上校的话，你一定听见了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-anseitzFirstSpeech-3904": "NIKOLAI: 长官，这城市不是中立的吗？卢斯基亚人占领过这里几百年，本地人比我们更恨他们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-anseitzFirstSpeech-3905": "OFFICER: 有没有抵抗组织，并不重要。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-anseitzFirstSpeech-3906": "OFFICER: 城里的非法施法者还在消耗地脉中的魔力，而舰队需要那些能量。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-anseitzFirstSpeech-3907": "OFFICER: 你的任务是调查城里还在燃烧的区域，只有你有经验，能够安全地进去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-anseitzFirstSpeech-3908": "OFFICER: 情报显示，敌方法师正利用魔法火焰掩护藏身处。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-anseitzFirstSpeech-3909": "OFFICER: 终端还在吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-anseitzFirstSpeech-3910": "NIKOLAI: 在，长官。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-anseitzFirstSpeech-3911": "OFFICER: 用终端里的探寻术确定可能有藏身处的位置，之后由我的人接手。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-anseitzFirstSpeech-3912": "OFFICER: 我来补充魔力。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-anseitzFirstSpeech-3913": "OFFICER: 记住，找那些像是被周围火焰保护着的建筑，动作快。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-fireSafety-3914": "SOLDIER: 上士，给您弄了个灭火器。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-fireSafety-3915": "SOLDIER: 抱歉，正式的消防物资还没到，暂时只有这个。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-fireSafety-3916": "NIKOLAI: 好，我给你们讲几条最基本的火场规矩。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-fireSafety-3917": "NIKOLAI: 任何火场都有危险，我叫撤，就立刻退出去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-fireSafety-3918": "NIKOLAI: 本该是凉的东西，摸着却发热，就退远点。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-fireSafety-3919": "NIKOLAI: 进了屋子，绝不能让火蔓延到你头顶或脚下。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-fireSafety-3920": "NIKOLAI: 不过，我也没打算在这些屋子里待太久。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-fireSafety-3921": "NIKOLAI: 目标就是那栋房子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-firstBunker-3922": "NIKOLAI: 科尼茨，终端怎么说？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-firstBunker-3923": "KONITZ: 这里有魔物，说明我们可能找对地方了，因为它们会被集中的魔力吸引。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-firstBunker-3924": "KONITZ: 我检查一下……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-firstBunker-3925": "KONITZ: 好，读数有反应。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-firstBunker-3926": "NIKOLAI: 魏斯，去把上校的人叫来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-firstBunker-3927": "NIKOLAI: 趁这会儿有空，科尼茨，你跟我说说，魔力地脉到底是个什么东西？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-firstBunker-3928": "KONITZ: 哦……呃，您听说过火之圣祠吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-firstBunker-3929": "NIKOLAI: 嗯，魔法就是从那儿来的，对吧？好像是在一座火山里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-firstBunker-3930": "KONITZ: 嗯……地脉就是地下流动的熔岩，将魔力输送到各地。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-firstBunker-3931": "MUELLER: 这么说，地脉里的魔力也会被抽干？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-firstBunker-3932": "KONITZ: 会，不过过一段时间也能恢复，魔力少的时候，能施展的本事自然就有限了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-firstBunker-3933": "KONITZ: 听说城下这条地脉一直通到卢斯基亚腹地，我猜军队就是因此才这么需要它。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-firstBunker-3934": "WEISS: 人叫来了，班长。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-firstBunker-3935": "SOLDIER: 接下来交给我们，普罗赫上士。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-kaboom1-3936": "NIKOLAI: ……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-dontBother-3937": "NIKOLAI: 这处火再过几分钟就会自己灭，不浪费时间了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-secondBunker-3938": "KONITZ: 终端探测到东西了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-secondBunker-3939": "NIKOLAI: 米勒，叫安赛茨的人过来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-secondBunker-3940": "KONITZ: 上士，他们是要我们进去吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-secondBunker-3941": "NIKOLAI: 指挥部要是真指望咱们进去，就不会只给一个灭火器。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-secondBunker-3942": "WEISS: 您这话说得实在，上士。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-secondBunker-3943": "NIKOLAI: 下士，你那点高见，留着自己蹲茅房时慢慢想。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-secondBunker-3944": "SOLDIER: 这里交给我们，上士。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-noBunkerB-3945": "KONITZ: 上士，终端没探测到魔力。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-noBunkerA-3946": "NIKOLAI: 不，这火太小，不足以掩护藏身处……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-noBunkerC-3947": "KONITZ: 没有魔力迹象，上士。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-noBunkerC-3948": "NIKOLAI: 好吧……他不在里面。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-noBunkerD-3949": "NIKOLAI: 不，这里应该也没有。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-noBunkerE-3950": "NIKOLAI: 这里应该也没有。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-dontBother2-3951": "NIKOLAI: 这处火很快也会自己灭。回头再来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-thirdBunker-3952": "NIKOLAI: 这里呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-thirdBunker-3953": "KONITZ: 呃……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-thirdBunker-3954": "KONITZ: 有，而且很强。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-thirdBunker-3955": "NIKOLAI: 你们在这里等着。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-thirdBunker-3956": "NIKOLAI: 我进去看一眼。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-thirdBunker-3957": "NIKOLAI: （没有烟……空气凉……石地板……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-thirdBunker-3959": "KONITZ: 上士？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-thirdBunker-3960": "NIKOLAI: 士兵，我叫你在外面等着。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-thirdBunker-3961": "KONITZ: 对不起，刚才……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-thirdBunker-3962": "KONITZ: ……魔力输出突然升高了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-thirdBunker-3963": "KONITZ: 不过，大概只是故障。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-thirdBunker-3964": "NIKOLAI: 没错。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-thirdBunker-3965": "NIKOLAI: 现在出去，这里危险。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-thirdBunker-3966": "OFFICER: 普罗赫上士，听说你的终端探测到了什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-thirdBunker-3967": "NIKOLAI: 呃，是，长官，不过查明是误报。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-thirdBunker-3968": "OFFICER: 是吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-thirdBunker-3969": "KONITZ: 是，长官，大概是未爆弹，里面还残留着魔力。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-thirdBunker-3970": "OFFICER: 是这样？那么……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-thirdBunker-3971": "OFFICER: 继续去下一个区域吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-thirdBunker-3972": "NIKOLAI: 长官？里面不安全，屋顶和墙壁已经撑不住了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-thirdBunker-3973": "OFFICER: 我们不进去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-thirdBunker-3974": "SOLDIER: 要爆破了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-thirdBunker-3975": "OFFICER: 上士。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-thirdBunker-3976": "OFFICER: 上士，你该走了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-thirdBunker-3977": "NIKOLAI: 抱歉，长官。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-thirdBunker-3978": "NIKOLAI: 科尼茨呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-thirdBunker-3979": "WEISS: 他大概被爆炸吓着，跑了，应该没跑远。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-detonators-3980": "SOLDIER: 你的技术兵为什么把我们的雷管全拿走了？解释一下？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-detonators-3981": "NIKOLAI: 他只是……受了点惊，我会把东西拿回来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzCheckpoint-3982": "NIKOLAI: 我那个技术兵来过吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzCheckpoint-3983": "SOLDIER: 好像看见了，不过没从我们这儿过，也不知道去哪儿了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzCheckpoint-3984": "NIKOLAI: （得找到科尼茨……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-3985": "NIKOLAI: 科尼茨，在里面吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-3986": "NIKOLAI: 门从里面闩上了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-3987": "NIKOLAI: 科尼茨，你在里面做什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-3988": "KONITZ: 拆他们的雷管。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-3989": "NIKOLAI: 士兵，清醒一点。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-3990": "NIKOLAI: 拆掉几件爆炸物，阻止不了这里正在发生的事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-3991": "????: 当然阻止不了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-3992": "ANSEITZ: 上士，这里出什么问题了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-3993": "NIKOLAI: 报告长官，只是士气暂时受了点影响。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-3994": "ANSEITZ: 嗯，这种事总归难免。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-3995": "ANSEITZ: 士兵，我是安赛茨上校。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-3996": "ANSEITZ: 我知道，你被这座城里的景象吓住了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-3997": "ANSEITZ: 你必须明白，我们身处铁一般的时代，也必须有铁一般的心肠。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-3998": "ANSEITZ: 如果我们的目的仅仅是做这些残酷的事，那我们无疑就是怪物。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-3999": "ANSEITZ: 但我们的目的不是这个！我们要的是最终掌控魔法，让整个世界迎来和平！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-4000": "ANSEITZ: 历史要审判的只有我一人，责任由我承担，不在你身上。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-4001": "NIKOLAI: （科尼茨，别犯傻……这么多人看着，他不可能轻饶你……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-4002": "ANSEITZ: 士兵，立刻带着雷管出来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-4003": "KONITZ: 长官，我……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-4004": "ANSEITZ: 我从十开始倒数。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-4005": "ANSEITZ: 十。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-4006": "ANSEITZ: 九。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-4007": "ANSEITZ: 八。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-4008": "KONITZ: 长官，我们不能……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-4009": "ANSEITZ: 动手。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-4010": "OFFICER: 管好你的人，上士，谁想正式调走，可以去司令部申请。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-4011": "NIKOLAI: 我们得……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-4012": "NIKOLAI: 你们两个回检查站，告诉他们，我们需要真正的消防装备。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-4013": "NIKOLAI: 防护头罩、外套、手套、消防裤[oxfordComma /]和门楔。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-4014": "MUELLER: 您呢，上士？您……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-4015": "NIKOLAI: 终端在科尼茨那里，我得趁它还没熔掉拿回来，你们去吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-4016": "NIKOLAI: 对不起，这个坑不太……他们连把铲子都没给我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-4017": "NIKOLAI: 我会告诉你母亲，你是在战斗中牺牲的，也许这样好些……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-4018": "NIKOLAI: 我怎么还跟你说话，好像你听得见一样？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-4019": "NIKOLAI: （什么声音？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-4020": "NIKOLAI: （这是什么味道？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-4021": "NIKOLAI: （煤气？主管道也烧起来了？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-4022": "NIKOLAI: 小心！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-4023": "????: 这边！你来！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinal-4024": "????: 这里，有门！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-pavelWalk-4025": "????: 这边。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-pavelAnteMove-4026": "????: 这里，有路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-pavelAnteMove-4027": "????: 啊，我叫帕维尔。这边。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeScene-4028": "NIKOLAI: 这是什么地方？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeScene-4029": "PAVEL: 伊纳人的地方。一个……叫什么……神殿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeScene-4030": "PAVEL: 工厂的主人，伊纳人。他很久以前走了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeScene-4031": "PAVEL: 门的那边，是安全地方。但是，我想我们开不了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templePavel-4032": "PAVEL: 这里，也许有开门的东西？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templePavel-4033": "PAVEL: 那声音，门那里？你看看。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeScene2-4034": "NIKOLAI: 嗯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeScene2-4035": "NIKOLAI: 终端？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeScene2-4036": "NIKOLAI: 刚才怎么了？这是什么东西？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeScene2-4037": "PAVEL: 是……czarobotna。呃……你们怎么说，是……魔法工人。我想只是故事，但是现在……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeScene2-4038": "CREATURE: ……齐卡隆……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeScene2-4039": "NIKOLAI: 什么？那是……你的名字？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeScene2-4040": "ZIKARON: ……尼古拉……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeScene2-4041": "ZIKARON: ……来……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeScene2-4042": "PAVEL: 我不了解 czarobotna，但是这边过去，是安全地方。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeScene2-4043": "PAVEL: 还有其他人。你告诉他们，你认识我，帕维尔。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeDrawing-4044": "NIKOLAI: 画的是……四棵树？左上那棵打了个叉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeDrawing-4045": "NIKOLAI: 画的是……四棵树？右上那棵打了个叉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeDrawing-4046": "NIKOLAI: 画的是……四棵树？左下那棵打了个叉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeDrawing-4047": "NIKOLAI: 画的是……四棵树？右下那棵打了个叉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeDrawing-4048": "NIKOLAI: 画了八条横线。左上那条打了个叉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeDrawing-4049": "NIKOLAI: 画了八条横线。左侧中间两条打了叉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeDrawing-4050": "NIKOLAI: 画了八条横线。左下那条打了个叉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeDrawing-4051": "NIKOLAI: 画了八条横线。右上那条打了个叉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeDrawing-4052": "NIKOLAI: 画了八条横线。右侧中间两条打了叉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeDrawing-4053": "NIKOLAI: 画了八条横线。右下那条打了个叉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeDrawing-4054": "NIKOLAI: 这个对象没有正确配置。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeWallSwitch-4055": "NIKOLAI: 墙上有个小开关……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeFloorSwitch-4056": "NIKOLAI: 地板上有个小开关……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeDoorApproach-4057": "NIKOLAI: 门上写着什么，可我看不懂。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeDoorApproach-4058": "PAVEL: 我也不会伊纳语。但我看，那里好像还有……画？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-templeDoorApproach-4059": "NIKOLAI: 你是说，门上有幅画？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-zikaronJoin-4060": "NIKOLAI: 又是你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-zikaronJoin-4061": "ZIKARON: ……齐卡隆……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-zikaronJoin-4062": "NIKOLAI: 能让一让吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-zikaronJoin-4063": "NIKOLAI: 你想干什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-zikaronJoin-4064": "ZIKARON: ……加入……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-zikaronJoin-4065": "NIKOLAI: 好极了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-bekkerIntro-4066": "????: 你居然把他带到这里来，蠢不蠢！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-bekkerIntro-4067": "PAVEL: 他要是想杀我，又何必先救我？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-bekkerIntro-4068": "????: Dupek！咱们真是一个家里长大的！？帕维尔，他是间谍！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-bekkerIntro-4069": "PAVEL: 马特乌什，你看，他就在这里。身后跟着一个团吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-bekkerIntro-4070": "NIKOLAI: 他说得对，间谍不会穿着军装到处走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-bekkerIntro-4071": "MATEUSZ: 一个步兵，雷津语说得倒不错。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-bekkerIntro-4072": "NIKOLAI: 你在说什么？雷津语我一个字都不会。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-bekkerIntro-4073": "PAVEL: 可我们说的也不是奥斯伦语啊……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-bekkerIntro-4074": "????: 是那个造物。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-bekkerIntro-4075": "????: 我能看见它施的魔法，似乎在你们开口时，就把说的话翻译给了对方。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-bekkerIntro-4076": "????: 那么，你是……哪位上士？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-bekkerIntro-4077": "NIKOLAI: 普罗赫。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-bekkerIntro-4078": "????: 你跟安赛茨上校一起行动。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-bekkerIntro-4079": "NIKOLAI: 不，我……我是被派过去的，可是……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-bekkerIntro-4080": "NIKOLAI: 我把人从火里救出来，不是往火里扔。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-bekkerIntro-4081": "NIKOLAI: 你也是奥斯伦人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-bekkerIntro-4082": "????: 我叫贝克。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-bekkerIntro-4083": "BEKKER: 我曾在首都行医，直到总理要我们违背自己的原则。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-bekkerIntro-4084": "NIKOLAI: 所以你现在帮这些人藏在下面？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-bekkerIntro-4085": "BEKKER: 不只是藏在这里。这地方叫兹鲁德沃，是一条地下河。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-bekkerIntro-4086": "BEKKER: 根据最古老的地图，顺着这条通道往西南走，就能离开城区。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-bekkerIntro-4087": "BEKKER: 只是河道里有危险的生物，需要你帮忙，为这些平民清出一条出城的路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-bekkerIntro-4088": "BEKKER: 当然，还有你旁边那位……朋友。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-bekkerIntro-4089": "NIKOLAI: 对，还有它。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-bekkerIntro-4090": "NIKOLAI: 军队迟早会找到这里，得抓紧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-ravineScene1-4091": "BEKKER: （怎么了？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-ravineScene1-4092": "NIKOLAI: （巡逻队。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-ravineScene1-4093": "SOLDIER: 赛斯霍尔茨中尉！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-ravineScene1-4094": "SEISHOLTZ: 什么事，士兵？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-ravineScene1-4095": "SOLDIER: 终端刚才探测到很强的反应，可突然又没了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-ravineScene1-4096": "SEISHOLTZ: 我看看。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-ravineScene1-4097": "SEISHOLTZ: 嗯……继续盯着，我马上回来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-ravineScene1-4098": "NIKOLAI: （这声音我认得……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-ravineScene1-4099": "BEKKER: （谁？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-ravineScene1-4100": "NIKOLAI: （那个军官，上回见他，还自称“基尔歇尔列兵”。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-ravineScene1-4101": "BEKKER: （总理那帮人，最喜欢到处安插密探。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-ravineScene1-4102": "BEKKER: （不过，他说的是什么装置？我没听说过。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-ravineScene1-4103": "NIKOLAI: （探测范围不算远，但还是得避开巡逻队。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-ravineScene1-4104": "NIKOLAI: （走。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-waveThem1-4105": "NIKOLAI: 嗯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-waveThem1-4106": "NIKOLAI: 看来得先帮他们过去，他们才能接应其他人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-waveThem1-4107": "按 \\[party\\] 呼叫帕维尔",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-waveSafeZone1-4108": "按 \\[party\\] 呼叫马特乌什",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-waveSafeZone1-4109": "MATEUSZ: 他们应该没看见我们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-waveThem2-4110": "NIKOLAI: 现在把帕维尔也接过来……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-waveThem2-4111": "按 \\[party\\] 呼叫帕维尔",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-waveSafeZone2-4112": "PAVEL: 你们先走，我们带其他幸存者跟上。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stral_ravine_caught-4113": "SOLDIER: 谁在那里！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4114": "NIKOLAI: 看来暂时安全了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4115": "NIKOLAI: 我想，你这计划还有下一步吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4116": "BEKKER: 有，附近有片森林，位置够偏僻，藏得住人，旁边还有一户愿意帮我们的农家。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4117": "NIKOLAI: 可我看，军队迟早也会对那些农民下手。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4118": "MATEUSZ: 应该所有人都到了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4119": "BEKKER: 好，可以用这些车运送伤员。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4120": "NIKOLAI: 等等，这声音——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4121": "NIKOLAI: 全体卧倒！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4122": "BEKKER: 他们怎么看见我们的？附近没有高地！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4123": "NIKOLAI: 不知道，除非……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4124": "NIKOLAI: 军官能不能像你一样，看见齐卡隆的魔法？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4125": "BEKKER: 也许能，不过我以为得再靠近一些才行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4126": "NIKOLAI: 嘿！齐卡隆！能不能……挪一挪？把他们引开？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4127": "ZIKARON: ……躲藏……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4128": "NIKOLAI: 怎么了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4129": "BEKKER: 不知道，我从没见过这种魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4130": "NIKOLAI: 嗯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4131": "SEISHOLTZ: ……普罗赫？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4132": "NIKOLAI: 基尔歇尔？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4133": "SEISHOLTZ: 你……叛徒！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4134": "BEKKER: 还会有人追来吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4135": "NIKOLAI: 很快就可能来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4136": "NIKOLAI: 他一定会向上面报告，这下我连回去的机会都没了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4137": "BEKKER: 你还想回去？回军队？看过这一切之后？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4138": "NIKOLAI: 要么回去，要么被打成叛徒，再也回不了家，我也只有这两个选择。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4139": "NIKOLAI: 这个世界就是这样，谁也没说过它公平。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4140": "NIKOLAI: 总之，现在说什么都没用了，先把这些人带出去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4141": "BEKKER: 不，等等，我得确定你是真心想帮这些人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4142": "NIKOLAI: 什么？没时间谈这个。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4143": "NIKOLAI: 我已经在帮他们了，真不知道你还想要什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4144": "BEKKER: 太多奥斯伦人已经不再自己决定该做什么，只知道照着当权者的命令行事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4145": "BEKKER: 我想确定你是个有良知的人，是自己选择了帮助他们，而不是因为再无别的路可走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4146": "BEKKER: 如果你最终会后悔，我不希望你跟来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4147": "NIKOLAI: 听着，我只是村里一个面包师的儿子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4148": "NIKOLAI: 等你找到“有良知的人”之前，恐怕也只能先将就我了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4149": "NIKOLAI: 可眼下呢？我们还有事要办。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralFinale-4150": "BEKKER: 可这样……够吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stral_check_fire_game-4151": "扑灭这处火焰？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stral_check_fire_game-4152": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stral_check_fire_game-4153": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stral_check_fire_game-4154": "NIKOLAI: 还没到目标，灭火器就用完了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stral_check_fire_game-4155": "NIKOLAI: 这灭火器用不了几次，省着点。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralNoBack-4156": "NIKOLAI: 得继续前进。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-firePuzzle2-4157": "SOLDIER: 上士，又给您拿来一个灭火器。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-firePuzzle2-4158": "NIKOLAI: 我们得去那些火的东边，寻找下一个藏身处。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-firePuzzle2-4159": "SOLDIER: 我们会尽快再拿一个来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-notKonitz-4160": "NIKOLAI: 科尼茨！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-notKonitz-4161": "NIKOLAI: 他应该没跑这么远。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-notKonitz-4162": "NIKOLAI: 他应该没跑这么远。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-konitzFinder-4163": "NIKOLAI: 科尼茨一定躲在这些屋子里的某一栋。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-stralWarning-4164": "NIKOLAI: 马上就要进火场了。很可能有一阵子退不出来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stral.yarn-zrodoloHPtome-4165": "找到生命宝典！"
}
